{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，《GTA6》上市後，玩家發現遊戲內一款名為Coil Raiden的電動車具備特殊防盜機制。該車外形與早期Model S頗為相似，被玩家稱為遊戲裏的「特斯拉」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/funny/1587640.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:13:57.657857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_hash":"be4300739f20caafbe39f874690954ede3ff781de5479fe5c9bd8031c499600e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}